<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Moregro interim shr dips, no div.</title>
<headline>Moregro interim shr dips, no div.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     15.6	  vs 17.1</p>
<p>Fully diluted</p>
<p>     shr (cts)		15.5	  vs 15.4</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   10.59	 vs  8.42</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   17.38	 vs 12.99</p>
<p>    Tax			  6.79	 vs  4.57</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    8.90	 vs  6.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		 394.75	 vs 268.49</p>
<p>Full name: Moregro </p>
<p>NOTE - Formerly Morkels Retail Group Ltd, Moregro's results reflect its enlarged trading and capital base following its rights issue and acquisition of Bergers.</p>
<p>The group said that prospects for the rest of the year were positive but that the three trading months through to January would be critical in the light of softer demand already experienced in the retail sector.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
